			// 		$wt = round($p->pkg * $apa->getBreakWeight($p->weight, $p->pkg), 2);
			// 		$t = Tranship::model()->find('pid = :pid AND connote = :ref', [':pid' => $p->id, ':ref' => $p->ref]);
			// 		$xls->addRow($i++, [$p->ref, $wt, $p->postcode, empty($t)? '' : $t->mdata['oid']]);
			// 	}
			// 	include_once('PHPMailer/class.phpmailer.php');
			// 	$mail = new PHPMailer();
			// 	$mail->CharSet = 'UTF-8';
			// 	$mail->IsHTML(true);
			// 	$mail->SMTPSecure = 'tls'; 
			// 	$mail->Host = 'mail.pcaexpress.com.au';  // Specify main and backup SMTP servers
		 //        $mail->Port = 587;         
		 //        $mail->SMTPAuth = true; // Enable SMTP authentication
			// 	$mail->Username = 'importstest@toplogistics.com.au'; // SMTP username
			// 	$mail->Password = '3g%c2a#76ejiQu22';

			// 	$mail->From     = 'imports@toplogistics.com.au';
			// 	$mail->FromName = 'PCA Express';
			// 	$mail->Subject  = 'Manifest '.date('Y-m-d');
			// 	$mail->Body = 'Please find attached AP lodgement manifest';
			// 	$mail->AddStringAttachment($xls->output(null, null, false), 'Manifest_'.date('Ymd').'.xlsx', 'base64');
			// 	$addrs = [
			// 		'domestic1@ecof.com.au',
			// 		'solo.wang@ecof.com.au',
			// 		'mandy.liang@ecof.com.au',
			// 	];
			// 	foreach ($addrs as $add) {
			// 		$mail->AddAddress($add);
			// 	}
			// 	$mail->AddCC('imports@toplogistics.com.au');
			// 	//$mail->AddAddress('test@orite.com');
			// 	$mail->Send();
			// }
		}
		
		if(!empty($ars)){ // create retrun shipments
			// $apa = new AusPostAPI('syd');
			// $max_ppg = 1000;
			// $pgs = ceil(count($ars) / $max_ppg);
			// for($pg = 0; $pg < $pgs; $pg++){
			// 	$ss = array_slice($ars, $pg * $max_ppg, $max_ppg);
			// 	$result = $apa->createShipments($ss, 'PR');
			// 	if ($result && isset($result->shipments) && is_array($result->shipments)) {
			// 		$transaction= Yii::app()->db->beginTransaction();
			// 		try {
			// 			foreach($result->shipments as $aushipment){
			// 				if(isset($ars[$aushipment->shipment_reference])){
			// 					$ars[$aushipment->shipment_reference]->mdata['ap_sid'] = $aushipment->shipment_id;
			// 					$ars[$aushipment->shipment_reference]->updateMeta();
			// 					$apa->createLabels($aushipment->shipment_id);
			// 				}
			// 			}
			// 			$transaction->commit();
			// 		} catch (Exception $ex) {
			// 			$transaction->rollback();
			// 			Log::log2file("Aupost Returns ".$cn->no."=>".$ex->getMessage(), "transaction_err_log", "transaction");
			// 			throw $ex;
			// 		}
			// 	} else {
			// 		foreach ($apa->err as $e) {
			// 			$msg = $e->message;
			// 			if (!empty($e->field) && preg_match('/shipments\[(\d+)\]/', $e->field, $m)) {
			// 				$msg .= ': '.$ars[$m[1]]->hbn;
			// 			}
			// 			$err[] = $msg;
			// 		}
			// 	}
			// }
			// $this->doAupostReturnManifest($ars, $cn);
			
			$arrayPrefix2ShipmentArray = $this->funcArrayPrefix2ShipmentArray($ars);
			foreach($arrayPrefix2ShipmentArray as $Prefix => $ShipmentArray){
				$this->doAupostReturnManifest($ShipmentArray,$Prefix, $cn);
			}
		}
		

		if (!empty($aes)) {
			// $this->doAupostExpressManifest($aes, $cn);
			$arrayPrefix2ShipmentArray = $this->funcArrayPrefix2ShipmentArray($aes);
			foreach($arrayPrefix2ShipmentArray as $Prefix => $ShipmentArray){
				$this->doAupostExpressManifest($ShipmentArray,$Prefix, $cn);
			}
		}

		//do manifest
		if (!empty($consoleIds)) {
			ImcoConsol::updateImportConsoleBilling($consoleIds);
		}
		if(empty($cn->mdata['aupostsent'])){
			$cn->mdata['aupostsent'] = 1;
			$cn->custom_log_note = 'Aupost Manifested';
			$cn->updateMeta();
		}
		$this->actionUbiManifest($id);
		$this->actionChukou1Manifest($id);
		$this->actionGVAupost($id);
		if (empty($err)) {
			echo 'done';
		} else {
			echo implode('<br />', $err);
			Emailog::sendEmailTo($cn->getNoticeEmail(), "Aupost ".$cn->no." ".join(",",$err), $cn->no." Aupost Manifest ERROR");
		}
	}


	public function actionGVAupost($id)
	{
		$cn = $this->loadModel($id);

		//auspost lodgement
		$ss = [];
		$transaction=Yii::app()->db->beginTransaction();
		$err = [];
		$ars = [];
		
		try {
			foreach ($cn->shipments as $s) {
				if (preg_match('/^(34KHX|34KG6|34KHY|34KHW|34WMP)\d{7}/', $s->ref, $m) && ($s->cbwf&ImParcel::CBWF_DIRECT_CONSOL_BASE)==0) { // only for eParcel shipment and Not sent yet
					// check if manifested
					if (!empty($s->trans)) {
						foreach ($s->trans as $tran) {
							if ($tran->connote == $s->ref) continue 2;
						}
					}

					if(!empty($s->mdata['aupost_return'])){
						if(empty($s->mdata['ap_sid'])) $ars[$s->hbn] = $s;
						continue;
					} else if (!empty($s->mdata['aupost_exp'])) {
						if (empty($s->mdata['ap_sid'])) $aes[$s->hbn] = $s;
						continue;
					}
					// add a feature for logment eparcel before report custom port
					$direct_eparcel=false; //set a flag
					if (!empty($s->mdata['chargecode'])) {
						$chargecodeInfo= ImportChargeCode::model()->find('chargecode=:chargecode AND status=1', [":chargecode"=>$s->mdata['chargecode']]);
						if (!empty($chargecodeInfo)) {
							if (!empty($chargecodeInfo->mdata['direct_courier'])) {
								$direct_eparcel=true;
								$s->mdata['direct_courier']=2;// direct log eparcel 2 means a flag when success we will change it to 1
								$s->updateMeta();
							}
						}
					}
					// only for we received the shipment which means has been scanned in our warehouse
					// and status is cleared $s->getOutPkg() == $s->pkg
					if (($s->getOutPkg() > 0 && in_array($s->status, ImParcel::$allow_manifest_states)) || $direct_eparcel || $cn->owner_id == Org::ORGID_CLIENT_TLA || $cn->owner_id == 3441) {
						$s->cnee->checkPostcode();
						if(strlen($s->cnee->suburb) > 40){
							$err[] = $s->hbn.' suburb too long!';
						}else{
							$ss[$m[1]][] = $s;
						}
					}
				}
			}
			$transaction->commit();
		} catch (Exception $ex) {
			$transaction->rollback();
			throw $ex;
		}

		if (!empty($err)) {
			echo implode('<br />', $err);
			return false;
		}

		$consoleIds=[];

		foreach($ss as $k => $ps){
			$err=array_merge($err, $this->doGVAupostManifest($ps, $k, $consoleIds, $cn));
		}
		
		if(!empty($err))
		{
			Emailog::sendEmailTo($cn->getNoticeEmail(), "Aupost ".$cn->no." ".join(",",$err), $cn->no." GV Aupost Manifest ERROR");
		}
	}



	private function funcArrayPrefix2ShipmentArray($arrayShipment){
		$arrayPrefix2ShipmentArray = [];
		foreach ($arrayShipment as $s) {
			preg_match('/^(AMQ|333UF|33EVH|33EVJ|34AWE)\d{7}/', $s->ref, $m);
			$arrayPrefix2ShipmentArray[$m[1]][] = $s;
		}
		return $arrayPrefix2ShipmentArray;
	}
	
	public function actionAupostInt($id){
		$cn = $this->loadModel($id);
		$ss = [];
		$err=[];
		foreach($cn->shipments as $s){
			if(!empty($s->mdata['ap_sid']) && $s->cnee->country != 'AU' && (empty($s->trans) || empty($s->trans[0]->mdata['oid']))){
				$ss[$s->mdata['ap_sid']] = $s;
			}
		}
		if(!empty($ss)){
			$apa = new AusPostAPI('syd', true, false);
			$r = $apa->createOrderFromShipments($ss, $cn->no);
			if (!empty($r->order)) {
				$transaction= Yii::app()->db->beginTransaction();
				try {
					$oid = $r->order->order_id;
					$mani = Manifest::model()->find('type = 90 and ref = :ref',[':ref'=>$oid]);
					if(empty($mani)){	
						$mani = new Manifest();
						$mani->fwd_id=101;
						$mani->type = 90;
						$mani->created = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
						$mani->ref = $oid;
					}else
					{
						$mani->created = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
					}
					$mani->save();

					$auPostShipments = [];
					foreach ($r->order->shipments as $aushipment) {
						$auPostShipments[$aushipment->shipment_id] = $aushipment;
					}

					foreach ($ss as $i => $s) {
						$maniMap = ManiMap::model()->find("mani_id = :mani_id and model = 'ImParcel' and fid = :fid",[":mani_id"=>$mani->id,":fid"=>$s->id]);
						if(empty($maniMap))
						{
							$maniMap = new ManiMap();
						}

						$maniMap->mani_id = $mani->id;
						$maniMap->model = 'ImParcel';
						$maniMap->fid = $s->id;
						$maniMap->status = 10;
						$maniMap->mdata['mani_time'] = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
						$maniMap->save();

						$ts = new Tranship;
						$ts->pid = $s->id;
						$ts->org_id = 101;  // for Australia post office
						$ts->man_id = $s->man_id;
						$ts->type = 80;  // shipment transfer to a different delivery courier
						$ts->status = 19; // in finally moving status
						$ts->connote = $s->ref;
						$ts->time = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
						$ts->mdata['oid'] = $oid;
						$aushipment = $auPostShipments[$s->mdata['ap_sid']];
						$ts->mdata['sid'] = $aushipment->shipment_id;

						$costValue = floatval($aushipment->shipment_summary->total_cost - $aushipment->shipment_summary->total_gst);
						$ts->cost = round($costValue, 2);
						$ts->save();

						$s->mdata['manifest_weight'] = $s->weight;
						$s->update('meta');
					}
					
					$transaction->commit();
				} catch (Exception $ex) {
					$transaction->rollback();
					Log::log2file("Aupost Manifest".$cn->no."=>".$ex->getMessage(), "transaction_err_log", "transaction");
					throw $ex;
				}
			} else {
				foreach ($apa->err as $e) {
					$msg = $e->message;
					if (!empty($e->field) && preg_match('/shipments\[(\d+)\]/', $e->field, $m)) {
						$msg .= ': '.$ss[$m[1]]->hbn;
					}
					$err[] = $msg;
				}
			}
		}
		return  $err;
	}
		
	/**
	 *
	 * @param $ss  Array of shipments
	 * @param $apa  AupostApi Interface for each mild
	 * @return $err Array
	 */
	public function doAupostManifest($sst, $mlid, &$consoleIds, $cn)
	{
		$acc = AusPostAPI::mlid2acc($mlid);
		if(empty($acc)) return false;
		$apa = new AusPostAPI($acc);
		$err=[];
		$shipment_created = in_array($mlid, ['33MBQ']);
		$chargeCode = AusPostAPI::CHARGE_CODE_POD;

		if (!empty($sst)) {

			$max_ppg = 1000;
			$pgs = ceil(count($sst) / $max_ppg);
			$consoleIds = [];
			for($pg = 0; $pg < $pgs; $pg++){
				$ss = array_slice($sst, $pg * $max_ppg, $max_ppg);
				$transaction= Yii::app()->db->beginTransaction();
				try {
					if($shipment_created){
						$r = $apa->createOrderFromShipments($ss, $cn->no.($pgs>1? '-'.$pg : ''));
					}else{
						$r = $apa->createOrderIncludingShipments($ss, $cn->no.($pgs>1? '-'.$pg : ''), $chargeCode);
					}
					if (!empty($r->order)) {
						$oid = $r->order->order_id;
						$mani = Manifest::model()->find('type = 90 and ref = :ref',[':ref'=>$oid]);
						if(empty($mani))
						{	
							$mani = new Manifest();
							$mani->fwd_id=101;
							$mani->type = 90;
							$mani->created = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
							$mani->ref = $oid;
						}else
						{
							$mani->created = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
						}
						$mani->save();

						// because aupost returned shipment is not the same order with our sending order
						// so here we need to order by HBN again
						$auPostShipments = [];
						foreach ($r->order->shipments as $aushipment) {
							$auPostShipments[$shipment_created? $aushipment->shipment_id : $aushipment->shipment_reference] = $aushipment;
						}

						foreach ($ss as $i => $s) {
							$maniMap = ManiMap::model()->find("mani_id = :mani_id and model = 'ImParcel' and fid = :fid",[":mani_id"=>$mani->id,":fid"=>$s->id]);
							if(empty($maniMap))
							{
								$maniMap = new ManiMap();
							}

							$maniMap->mani_id = $mani->id;
							$maniMap->model = 'ImParcel';
							$maniMap->fid = $s->id;
							$maniMap->status = 10;
							$maniMap->mdata['mani_time'] = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
							$maniMap->save();


							$ts = new Tranship;
							$ts->pid = $s->id;
							$ts->org_id = 101;  // for Australia post office
							$ts->man_id = $s->man_id;
							$ts->type = 80;  // shipment transfer to a different delivery courier
							$ts->status = 19; // in finally moving status
							$ts->connote = $s->ref;
							$ts->time = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
							$ts->mdata['oid'] = $oid;
							if($shipment_created){
								$aushipment = $auPostShipments[$s->mdata['ap_sid']];
							}else{
								$aushipment = $auPostShipments[$s->hbn];
							}
							$ts->mdata['sid'] = $aushipment->shipment_id;

							$costValue = floatval($aushipment->shipment_summary->total_cost - $aushipment->shipment_summary->total_gst);
							if(!empty($s->mdata['org_rate_id']))
							{
								$orgRate = OrgRate::model()->findByPk($s->mdata['org_rate_id']);
								$cost = ImcoConsol::getCourierCostPrice($orgRate, $s->cnee->postcode, $s->weight, $s->pkg, true, $s->cnee->suburb);
								$cost = $cost==99999?0:$cost;
								$ts->cost = round($cost, 2);
							}else
							{
								$ts->cost = round($costValue, 2);
							}

							$ts->save();
							if (!empty($s->mdata['direct_courier'])&&$s->mdata['direct_courier']==2) {
								$s->cbwf=($s->cbwf^32)&$s->cbwf;
								$s->cbwf=$s->cbwf|64;
								$s->mdata['direct_courier']=1;
								$s->updateMeta();
								$s->update(['cbwf']);
							}
							// save all related console's id so that we can update their delivery cost
							if ($s->consol_id  > 0) {
								array_push($consoleIds, $s->consol_id);
							}
						}
					} else {
						foreach ($apa->err as $e) {
							$msg = $e->message;
							if (!empty($e->field) && preg_match('/shipments\[(\d+)\]/', $e->field, $m)) {
								$msg .= ': '.$ss[$m[1]]->hbn;
							}
							$err[] = $msg;
						}
					}
					$transaction->commit();
				} catch (Exception $ex) {
					$transaction->rollback();
					Log::log2file("Aupost Manifest".$cn->no."=>".$ex->getMessage(), "transaction_err_log", "transaction");
					throw $ex;
				}
			}
		}
		return  $err;
	}

	/**
	 *
	 * @param $ss  Array of shipments
	 * @param $apa  AupostApi Interface for each mild
	 * @return $err Array
	 */
	public function doGVAupostManifest($sst, $mlid, &$consoleIds, $cn)
	{
		$acc = GvAusPostAPI::mlid2acc($mlid);
		if(empty($acc)) return false;
		$apa = new GvAusPostAPI($acc);
		$err=[];
		$shipment_created = in_array($mlid, ['33MBQ']);
		$chargeCode =$apa->charge_code_pod;

		if (!empty($sst)) {

			$max_ppg = 1000;
			$pgs = ceil(count($sst) / $max_ppg);
			$consoleIds = [];
			for($pg = 0; $pg < $pgs; $pg++){
				$ss = array_slice($sst, $pg * $max_ppg, $max_ppg);
				$r = $apa->createOrderIncludingShipments($ss, $cn->no.($pgs>1? '-'.$pg : ''), $chargeCode);
				if($r===false) continue;
				$transaction= Yii::app()->db->beginTransaction();
				try {
					if (!empty($r->order)) {
						$oid = $r->order->order_id;
						$mani = Manifest::model()->find('type = 90 and ref = :ref',[':ref'=>$oid]);
						if(empty($mani))
						{	
							$mani = new Manifest();
							$mani->fwd_id=Org::ORGID_COURIER_GV_AUPOST;
							$mani->type = 90;
							$mani->created = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
							$mani->ref = $oid;
						}else
						{
							$mani->created = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
						}
						$mani->save();

						// because aupost returned shipment is not the same order with our sending order
						// so here we need to order by HBN again
						$auPostShipments = [];
						foreach ($r->order->shipments as $aushipment) {
							$auPostShipments[$shipment_created? $aushipment->shipment_id : $aushipment->shipment_reference] = $aushipment;
						}

						foreach ($ss as $i => $s) {
							$maniMap = ManiMap::model()->find("mani_id = :mani_id and model = 'ImParcel' and fid = :fid",[":mani_id"=>$mani->id,":fid"=>$s->id]);
							if(empty($maniMap))
							{
								$maniMap = new ManiMap();
							}

							$maniMap->mani_id = $mani->id;
							$maniMap->model = 'ImParcel';
							$maniMap->fid = $s->id;
							$maniMap->status = 10;
							$maniMap->mdata['mani_time'] = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
							$maniMap->save();


							$ts = new Tranship;
							$ts->pid = $s->id;
							$ts->org_id = Org::ORGID_COURIER_GV_AUPOST;  // for Australia post office
							$ts->man_id = $s->man_id;
							$ts->type = 80;  // shipment transfer to a different delivery courier
							$ts->status = 19; // in finally moving status
							$ts->connote = $s->ref;
							$ts->time = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
							$ts->mdata['oid'] = $oid;
							if($shipment_created){
								$aushipment = $auPostShipments[$s->mdata['ap_sid']];
							}else{
								$aushipment = $auPostShipments[$s->hbn];
							}
							$ts->mdata['sid'] = $aushipment->shipment_id;

							$costValue = floatval($aushipment->shipment_summary->total_cost - $aushipment->shipment_summary->total_gst);
							if(!empty($s->mdata['org_rate_id']))
							{
								$orgRate = OrgRate::model()->findByPk($s->mdata['org_rate_id']);
								$cost = ImcoConsol::getCourierCostPrice($orgRate, $s->cnee->postcode, $s->weight, $s->pkg, true, $s->cnee->suburb);
								$cost = $cost==99999?0:$cost;
								$ts->cost = round($cost, 2);
							}else
							{
								$ts->cost = round($costValue, 2);
							}

							$ts->save();
							if (!empty($s->mdata['direct_courier'])&&$s->mdata['direct_courier']==2) {
								$s->cbwf=($s->cbwf^32)&$s->cbwf;
								$s->cbwf=$s->cbwf|64;
								$s->mdata['direct_courier']=1;
								$s->updateMeta();
								$s->update(['cbwf']);
							}
							// save all related console's id so that we can update their delivery cost
							if ($s->consol_id  > 0) {
								array_push($consoleIds, $s->consol_id);
							}
						}
					} else {
						foreach ($apa->err as $e) {
							$msg = $e->message;
							if (!empty($e->field) && preg_match('/shipments\[(\d+)\]/', $e->field, $m)) {
								$msg .= ': '.$ss[$m[1]]->hbn;
							}
							$err[] = $msg;
						}
					}
					$transaction->commit();
				} catch (Exception $ex) {
					$transaction->rollback();
					Log::log2file("Aupost Manifest".$cn->no."=>".$ex->getMessage(), "transaction_err_log", "transaction");
					throw $ex;
				}
			}
		}
		return  $err;
	}

	public function doAupostReturnManifest($sst, $strPrefix, $cn)
	{
		$acc = AusPostAPI::mlid2acc($strPrefix);
		if(empty($acc)) return false;
		$apa = new AusPostAPI($acc);
		// $apa = new AusPostAPI('syd');
		$max_ppg = 1000;
		$pgs = ceil(count($sst) / $max_ppg);
		for($pg = 0; $pg < $pgs; $pg++){
			$ss = array_slice($sst, $pg * $max_ppg, $max_ppg);
			$transaction = Yii::app()->db->beginTransaction();
			try {
				$r = $apa->createOrderIncludingShipments($ss, $cn->no . '-return' . ($pgs > 1 ? '-' . $pg : ''), 'PR');
				if (!empty($r->order)) {
					$oid = $r->order->order_id;
					$mani = Manifest::model()->find('type = 90 and ref = :ref',[':ref'=>$oid]);
					if(empty($mani))
					{	
						$mani = new Manifest();
						$mani->fwd_id=101;
						$mani->type = 90;
						$mani->created = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
						$mani->ref = $oid;
					}else
					{
						$mani->created = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
					}
					$mani->save();

					// because aupost returned shipment is not the same order with our sending order
					// so here we need to order by HBN again
					$auPostShipments = [];
					foreach ($r->order->shipments as $aushipment) {
						$auPostShipments[$shipment_created? $aushipment->shipment_id : $aushipment->shipment_reference] = $aushipment;
					}

					foreach ($ss as $i => $s) {
						$maniMap = ManiMap::model()->find("mani_id = :mani_id and model = 'ImParcel' and fid = :fid",[":mani_id"=>$mani->id,":fid"=>$s->id]);
						if(empty($maniMap))
						{
							$maniMap = new ManiMap();
						}

						$maniMap->mani_id = $mani->id;
						$maniMap->model = 'ImParcel';
						$maniMap->fid = $s->id;
						$maniMap->status = 10;
						$maniMap->mdata['mani_time'] = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
						$maniMap->save();


						$ts = new Tranship;
						$ts->pid = $s->id;
						$ts->org_id = 101;  // for Australia post office
						$ts->man_id = $s->man_id;
						$ts->type = 80;  // shipment transfer to a different delivery courier
						$ts->status = 19; // in finally moving status
						$ts->connote = $s->ref;
						$ts->time = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
						$ts->mdata['oid'] = $oid;
						if($shipment_created){
							$aushipment = $auPostShipments[$s->mdata['ap_sid']];
						}else{
							$aushipment = $auPostShipments[$s->hbn];
						}
						$ts->mdata['sid'] = $aushipment->shipment_id;

						$costValue = floatval($aushipment->shipment_summary->total_cost - $aushipment->shipment_summary->total_gst);
						$ts->cost = round($costValue, 2);
						$ts->save();
						if (!empty($s->mdata['direct_courier'])&&$s->mdata['direct_courier']==2) {
							$s->cbwf=($s->cbwf^32)&$s->cbwf;
							$s->cbwf=$s->cbwf|64;
							$s->mdata['direct_courier']=1;
							$s->updateMeta();
							$s->update(['cbwf']);
						}
						// save all related console's id so that we can update their delivery cost
						// if ($s->consol_id  > 0) {
						// 	array_push($consoleIds, $s->consol_id);
						// }
					}
				} else {
					foreach ($apa->err as $e) {
						$msg = $e->message;
						if (!empty($e->field) && preg_match('/shipments\[(\d+)\]/', $e->field, $m)) {
							$msg .= ': '.$ss[$m[1]]->hbn;
						}
						$err[] = $msg;
					}
				}
				$transaction->commit();
			} catch (Exception $ex) {
				$transaction->rollback();
				Log::log2file("Aupost Return Manifest".$cn->no."=>".$ex->getMessage(), "transaction_err_log", "transaction");
				throw $ex;
			}
		}
	}

